[38;2;124;124;124mTotal weight = 1+2+...+4n = 4n(4n+1)/2 = 2n(4n+1). This is always even, so each [0m[38;2;124;124;124mpile needs weight n(4n+1).[0m

[38;2;124;124;124mFor each color, we need to choose 2 of the 4 pebbles to go in pile A (the other [0m[38;2;124;124;124m2 go to pile B). So for each color, there are C(4,2) = 6 choices.[0m

